To ensure a fast check-in at the Decentralised AI Builders Meetup, our venue partner (AWS…" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:url" content="https://luma.com/yzmp69am" data-next-head=""/><link rel="canonical" href="https://luma.com/yzmp69am" data-next-head=""/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en" href="https://luma.com/yzmp69am" data-next-head=""/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="x-default" href="https://luma.com/yzmp69am" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image:width" content="800"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="420"/><meta name="image" property="og:image" content="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event-social/3c/64a01951-9fed-4e3b-b82f-cc0d7642a755.png" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event-social/3c/64a01951-9fed-4e3b-b82f-cc0d7642a755.png" data-next-head=""/><meta name="apple-itunes-app" content="app-id=1546150895, app-argument=luma://event/evt-I4BApt3BBU14Wxs" data-next-head=""/><meta name="google" content="notranslate"/><meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"/><link rel="manifest" href="/pwa.webmanifest"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/chunks/2si_vdd0lboy8.css" as="style"/><meta name="sentry-trace" content="c45dc5c2b93c481197e9c7583a798e20-a013c4a64e51e13d"/><meta name="baggage" content="sentry-environment=production,sentry-release=985af28700b86ee650d2b0e7c7f86564156acf11,sentry-public_key=d4590a2b63da41fa80cd30c525a24bda,sentry-trace_id=c45dc5c2b93c481197e9c7583a798e20,sentry-org_id=370968"/><script data-cfasync="false" type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","@id":"https://luma.com/yzmp69am","url":"https://luma.com/yzmp69am","name":"Decentralized AI Builders Meetup","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","location":{"@type":"Place","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressCountry":"US","addressLocality":"San Francisco","addressRegion":"California","streetAddress":"AWS Builder Loft"},"name":"AWS Builder Loft","geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":37.790321299999995,"longitude":-122.399369},"latitude":37.790321299999995,"longitude":-122.399369},"image":["https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=1920,height=1920/event-covers/sc/456d24d5-ecf2-4bba-8679-1e9cd0fa4440.jpg","https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=1200,height=630/event-social/3c/64a01951-9fed-4e3b-b82f-cc0d7642a755.png"],"description":"Action Required: Pre-register for AWS Builder Loft\nHi everyone,\nTo ensure a fast check-in at the Decentralised AI Builders Meetup, our venue partner (AWS Builder Loft) requires you to register in their internal system:\nRegister Here: https://events.builder.aws.com/OaWvbG\nNote: The link may display the name \"X402 BUILDERS Meetup\"—this is correct.\nImportant: Bring a valid photo ID for security at the entrance.\nCompleting this now will save you from waiting in long lines at the door. See you there!\nBest regards, BitsLab Team\n\nLLMs generate text.\nAgents execute tasks.\nBlockchains provide state, ownership, and settlement.\nIf agents are to operate autonomously, they need verifiable identity, permissionless payments, and trust-minimized coordination — not platform accounts.\nThis meetup explores how AI and crypto can combine to create entirely new digital ecosystems.\n\nTopics\nAgent-to-Agent commerce (A2A)\nx402 ecosystem & ERC-8004\nCrypto settlement layer for AI\nSecure agent execution & identity\nMachine payments & PayFi\n\nAgenda\n\n5:00-6:00 pm check-in\n6:00-6:10 pm Keynote: AI Security for Digital Assets, Peter & Fox, BitsLab\n6:10-6:40 pm Panel: Building Autonomous AI Systems on Open Networks\nLeo — Cofounder & CTO, AEON\nRegan — Cofounder & CTO, PIN AI\nScott — Cofounder & CTO, Kite AI\n6:40-6:50 pm Keynote: Wallet V - Make Crypto Great for All, Stephen, Virgo\n6:50-7:20 pm Panel: AI as an Economic Actor — Data, Identity & Capital\nDon Gossen — Co-founder and CEO, Nevermined\nVictor — Founder, Namefi by D3Serve Labs\nRoy Liu — Co-founder, Superpower\nKira Song, Investor\n7:20 pm Networking\n\nAbout BitsLab\nBitsLab is an AI-driven security company focused on digital asset protection. It delivers an integrated solution of \"audit services + AI security engine + security tools\" for emerging Web3 ecosystems, helping developers and end users build, trade, and interact on-chain with greater safety.\nAbout Virgo\nVirgo is focusing on bridging the gap between traditional finance and Web3 by offering compliant fiat-to-crypto trading, OTC services, and wealth management for both retail and institutional clients. Its mission is to accelerate the global adoption of digital assets through a secure, user-friendly, and transparent ecosystem.\nAbout Langrenus Fund\nLangrenus Fund is a boutique investment institute, leading in Web 3.0 Investment, SPAC Advisory, Capital Raise, and M&A for Emerging growth companies since 2019.\nAbout AEON\nAEON is the next-generation crypto payment framework, built for AI to power intelligent, automated transactions across Web3, and to make crypto seamless, usable, and intuitive in everyday real life.\nAbout PIN AI\nPIN AI is an open platform for Personal AI, empowering users to reclaim their data from centralised platforms and train private, on-device AI models. The PIN Network integrates private compute, Trusted Execution Environments (TEEs), and blockchain verification to ensure secure interactions between humans and AI.\nAbout SafenAI\nSafenAI is a non-profit committed to fostering collaboration, equipping future leaders navigate the risks of the AI era, and driving early-stage innovations into mainstream applications.\nAbout CipherOwl\nThe CipherOwl API provides comprehensive information about cryptocurrency addresses for regulatory compliance and risk assessment. These APIs enable you to check sanctions status, evaluate risk scores, and access related compliance data.\nAbout Kite AI\nKite AI enables AI agents to autonomously transact at scale with cryptographic safety and native x402 compatibility—solving the infrastructure crisis imprisoning the agent economy today.\nAbout NameFi\nNamefi is an ICANN-accredited registrar that tokenises DNS ownership so you can register, trade, and build with AI tooling and on-chain security.\n\nFormat\nLightning Keynotes → Panel → Networking\n\nPizza & drinks provided 🍕\n\nImportant: Action Required for Your Entry to AWS Builder Loft\nHi everyone,\nWe are looking forward to seeing you at the Decentralized AI Builders Meetup!\nTo ensure a smooth and fast check-in process on the day of the event, our venue partner, AWS Builder Loft, now requires all attendees to register through their official internal system in addition to our event platform.\nWhat you need to do:\nRegister here: https://events.builder.aws.com/OaWvbG\nNote on Event Name: Please don't be confused if the link shows the event name as \"X402 BUILDERS Meetup\"—this is the correct link for our session.\nBring your ID: Please remember to bring a valid photo ID for security verification at the entrance.\nCompleting this registration now will help you avoid long lines and manual sign-ups at the door. Thank you for your cooperation, and we’ll see you soon!\nBest regards,\nBitsLab Team","startDate":"2026-03-04T17:00:00.000-08:00","endDate":"2026-03-04T20:30:00.000-08:00","organizer":[{"@type":"Person","name":"BitsLab","url":"https://luma.com/user/bitslab","image":"https://images.lumacdn.com/avatars/wz/4ca3d79d-2982-403d-b2d5-52e61cd93767.jpg"},{"@type":"Person","name":"BitsLab","url":"https://luma.com/user/bitslab","image":"https://images.lumacdn.com/avatars/wz/4ca3d79d-2982-403d-b2d5-52e61cd93767.jpg"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Peter Qin","url":"https://luma.com/user/usr-Lm2JsWlCKAAANJT","image":"https://images.lumacdn.com/avatars/rv/f7f09aaf-0e92-4e79-b76c-97144b04f812.jpg"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Bernie K","url":"https://luma.com/user/berniekong","image":"https://cdn.lu.ma/avatars-default/avatar_15.png"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Wickey Wang","url":"https://luma.com/user/usr-rvbK88j9Ejd5tVW","image":"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/fx/8b209a35-6491-4978-9910-354be9453876.png"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Leo Li","url":"https://luma.com/user/usr-EKGfJwQUZ8VTQBS","image":"https://cdn.lu.ma/avatars-default/avatar_11.png"},{"@type":"Person","name":"AWS Builder Loft","url":"https://luma.com/user/awsbuilderloft","image":"https://images.lumacdn.com/avatars/po/935e46d4-ea88-4f9f-b126-5991118e5465.png"}],"offers":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://luma.com/yzmp69am","name":"General Admission","price":0,"priceCurrency":"usd","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock"}]}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/2si_vdd0lboy8.css" data-n-g=""/><noscript data-n-css=""></noscript><script>(globalThis["TURBOPACK"] || (globalThis["TURBOPACK"] = [])).push({"otherChunks":["static/chunks/125l9cartzkau.js","static/chunks/26qu1mvgznbsg.js","static/chunks/2kr7jqxh0-8j-.js","static/chunks/2p7ar8ein2fk2.js","static/chunks/0azosb2f4xttl.js","static/chunks/0b853mr4wiyba.js","static/chunks/1knl5b8miwi4j.js","static/chunks/18mncysfxsjcg.js","static/chunks/2tz-oh_l8mggm.js","static/chunks/2i5p5xbcdbb51.js","static/chunks/2sl___ha3g0nr.js","static/chunks/1ye-v-q0_j0we.js","static/chunks/1izw6yzgummr-.js","static/chunks/2dqubnra0f3sc.js","static/chunks/1rnfc__d_9ezi.js","static/chunks/0w0ukcbkpt7nt.js","static/chunks/1whl3qhncs-jl.js","static/chunks/3qqimuf_r5ln3.js","static/chunks/2f6qvhv5v1zpk.js","static/chunks/2j1gz9zkv86ht.js","static/chunks/051b5ntdo6ndg.js","static/chunks/2je1r16geh_pa.js","static/chunks/0w172g2hu9n53.js","